OL,3,GNEWSAVote counting under way in the
OL,4,AHolborn and St Pancras by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FBallots are being counted in the
OL,7,FHolborn and St Pancras by-election
OL,9,FThe seat became vacant after former
OL,10,FPrime Minister Keir Starmer announced
OL,11,Fhe was standing down from the House of
OL,12,FCommons last month
OL,14,FFifteen candidates are standing in the
OL,15,Fby-election - you can read a full list
OL,16,Fhere
OL,18,FHolborn and St Pancras is a
OL,19,Fconstituency full of well-known London
OL,20,Flandmarks, and just under half of
OL,21,Fresidents are aged under-30 - take a
OL,22,Flook at our rundown here
